# Containerized execution rules for Cursor (arch-09 §7).
# Copy the relevant lines into the project root .cursorrules.

- Always execute terminal commands inside the Docker dev container, e.g.
  `docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml exec dev <command>`. Never run
  project build/test/deploy commands directly on the host.
- Prefer `/workspace` as the absolute path root for all file operations inside
  the container.
- Before running a batch of unattended, destructive-capable commands, create a
  git checkpoint (a commit or `git stash`) so the run is instantly recoverable
  (arch-09 §6).
